[en.FOCUS_C12_GIGGLE_AT_GHOSTY]
Giggle at Ghosty

[en.FOCUS_C12_GIGGLE_AT_GHOSTY_desc]
As the final political reforms came to a close, the rock farm would no longer be the backward and desolate place it was two years ago. Whatever the future held, the Pie family and the ponies on this land would face it with positivity. If Pinkie Pie were still here, she would surely find solace in that.

[zh.FOCUS_C12_GIGGLE_AT_GHOSTY]
对着妖魔大笑

[zh.FOCUS_C12_GIGGLE_AT_GHOSTY_desc]
随着最后的政治改革收尾，采石农场将不再是两年前那个落后又荒凉的地方了，无论未来发生什么，派家族和这块土地上的小马都将积极面对，如果萍琪派还在的话，她一定会感到欣慰的。

